## Vercel Web Analytics Implementation

Successfully installed and configured Vercel Web Analytics for the StackRadar Next.js project.

### Changes Made

**1. Package Installation**
- Installed `@vercel/analytics` package (version 1.5.0) using npm
- Updated `package.json` with the new dependency
- Updated `package-lock.json` with lockfile entries

**2. Analytics Integration**
- Modified `src/app/layout.tsx` to import Analytics component from `@vercel/analytics/next`
- Added the `<Analytics />` component to the root layout's body, positioned after the main content
- Preserved all existing functionality and component structure

### Implementation Details

Following the official Vercel documentation (https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/quickstart), I:

1. Used the Next.js App Router specific import: `import { Analytics } from "@vercel/analytics/next"`
2. Placed the Analytics component at the end of the body tag in the root layout
3. Maintained the existing code structure without disrupting any other functionality

The Analytics component is now positioned after the SmoothScrollProvider wrapper, ensuring it doesn't interfere with the app's smooth scrolling functionality or any other UI elements.

### Files Modified

- `frontend/package.json` - Added @vercel/analytics dependency
- `frontend/package-lock.json` - Updated with new package lockfile entries
- `frontend/src/app/layout.tsx` - Added Analytics import and component

### Verification

- ✅ Build completed successfully without errors
- ✅ TypeScript compilation passed
- ✅ Static pages generated successfully (27 pages)
- ✅ No new linting errors introduced
- ✅ Lockfile properly updated

### Next Steps

To fully enable Web Analytics:
1. Deploy this change to Vercel
2. Enable Web Analytics in the Vercel Dashboard (Analytics section)
3. After deployment, verify analytics are working by checking the Network tab for requests to `/_vercel/insights/*` or `/<unique-path>/view`

The analytics will automatically start collecting page views and other metrics once enabled in the Vercel Dashboard.
